==German==

===Etymology===
''zu'' "[[to]]" and a word related to "same", from Indo-European ''*samo-'' "[[same]]". Cognate with {{etyl|nl|-}} {{term|samen||together|lang=nl}}, {{etyl|sco|-}} {{term|samin||together|lang=sco}}.

===Adverb===
{{de-adv}}

# [[together]]

====Usage notes====
* {{chemistry|lang=de}} as an abbreviation, [[Z]], it is used to mean [[cis]] (see also [[entgegen]])

